有此〖30〗，必为人所教也。”﹝三﹞","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":149,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-q-o026","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-60f5f2906a17e7bc1611","layer":"original","quote":"明年卒，时年四十五。先主为之流涕者累日。谥曰翼侯。赐子邈爵关内侯，官至奉车都尉、汉阳太守。","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
